+    /**
+     * Redraw the loading splash at the given progress (0..1). The splash is the only thing
+     * on screen until startGame() finishes, and the window can still change size after
+     * creation (the OS settling it, or the user resizing), so adopt the live window size
+     * first; otherwise the stale-sized frame leaves part of the window undrawn.
